   "type": "pub-hero",
   "title": "施行善举能否获益？",
   "texts": [
    "<p><strong>宜家是如何实现民主设计的</strong></p>\n<p>撰文：CAMILLA TUBERTINI</p>",
    "施行善举能否获益？",
    "normal"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/images/ef/01/ef01af8a79c74a4b522c013727ac9378.png"
